                                "sense_id": "7289ba1c-d84f-3f33-9bb5-a1dedcf5c955",
                                "text": "The deal, expected to be completed by the summer, would be immediately accretive to cashflow and earnings per share while giving BP an extra 500,000 barrels per day."
